      <div id="TcHmiTextblock_6" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height-unit="%" data-tchmi-left="0" data-tchmi-left-unit="%" data-tchmi-text="MO1008-0000-1111 8-channel digital input, 24 V DC, M8

With eight digital inputs, acquires binary control signals from the process level and transfers them, with electrical isolation, to the controller. The signal state is shown on the display; the signal interface is established via screw-type M8 connectors.

In addition, various diagnostic options and configurable input filters are available for each channel. The short-circuit proof 24 V DC sensor power supply for the M8 connectors has electronic protection." data-tchmi-top="0" data-tchmi-top-unit="%" data-tchmi-width-unit="%" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True" data-tchmi-right="0" data-tchmi-right-unit="%" data-tchmi-bottom="0" data-tchmi-bottom-unit="%" data-tchmi-text-font-size="150" data-tchmi-text-font-size-unit="%">
</div>
</div>

